{"speciesId":772,"names":{"fr":"Type:0","es":"Código Cero","en":"Type: Null","ja":"タイプ：ヌル"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Le lourd masque qu’il porte est un limiteur qui l’empêche d’exprimer toute l’étendue de sa puissance. Il recèle une force mystérieuse."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"La pesada máscara le impide liberar toda su fuerza, que se cree que es extraordinaria."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"The heavy control mask it wears suppresses its intrinsic capabilities. This Pokémon has some hidden special power."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"重い 制御マスクを つけており 本来の 能力を だせない。 特別な 力を 秘めている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Ce Pokémon créé de toutes pièces porte un masque qui contient sa puissance et l’empêche de perdre le contrôle et de tout détruire."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Un Pokémon artificial. La máscara de contención que lleva sirve para evitar que se descontrole."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"Due to the danger that this synthetic Pokémon may go on a rampage, it wears a control mask to restrain its power."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"人工の ポケモン。 暴走の 危険が あるため 制御マスクで 力を 封印 されている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Développé en tant qu’arme dans un but bien précis, il est devenu incontrôlable lors d’une expérience et a dû être cryogénisé."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Este Pokémon se creó en un laboratorio como arma para cierto fin. Fue criogenizado tras desbocarse durante un experimento."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"A Pokémon weapon developed for a specific mission, it went berserk during an experiment, so it was cryogenically frozen."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"ある任務の ために 開発された ポケモン兵器。 実験中に 暴走した ため 凍結された。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"On lui fait porter un masque qui limite sa puissance afin d’éviter qu’il n’en perde le contrôle et sème le chaos."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"La máscara que lleva sirve para contener su verdadero poder y evitar que se descontrole."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"There’s danger of its going on a rampage, so its true power is sealed away beneath its control mask."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"暴走の 危険が あるため 制御マスクに よって 本当の 力を 封印 されているのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"On raconte qu’il aurait été recréé à Galar suite à un vol de documents de recherche hautement confidentiels."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Se rumorea que ha sido recreado en Galar a partir de documentos de investigación de alto secreto robados."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Rumor has it that the theft of top-secret research notes led to a new instance of this Pokémon being created in the Galar region."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"極秘だった 研究資料が 盗まれ ガラル地方で 新たに つくりだされたと 噂されている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il a été créé artificiellement d’après un Pokémon mythique. Il est muni d’un masque afin de contenir sa puissance."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Fue creado a imagen de un Pokémon mitológico. Lleva una máscara de contención para evitar que su poder se descontrole."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"It was modeled after a mighty Pokémon of myth. The mask placed upon it limits its power in order to keep it under control."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"神話の ポケモンを モデルに つくられたが 力の 暴走を 抑える マスクを 着けられている。"}],"varieties":[{"id":772,"moves":[{"name":"razor-wind","learns":[[17,"level-up",70],[18,"level-up",70]]},{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[17,"level-up",40],[18,"level-up",40],[20,"level-up",50]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[17,"level-up",80],[18,"level-up",80],[20,"level-up",55]]},{"name":"roa